WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.726
Electrons fill shells in order: two, then eight, then eight.

2
00:00:04.528 --> 00:00:09.128
Neon has ten electrons, in shells of two and eight. Both are full.

3
00:00:15.162 --> 00:00:19.337
Sodium's eleventh electron can't fit, so it starts a new shell.

4
00:00:20.162 --> 00:00:24.662
Shells fill in order: two, then eight, then eight. The outer shell matters most.
